#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CONFIGURE_OPTIONS.rst:2
msgid "CTEST_CONFIGURE_OPTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CONFIGURE_OPTIONS.rst:6
msgid ""
"Specify a :ref:`semicolon-separated list <CMake Language Lists>` of command-"
"line options for the :command:`ctest_configure` command to pass "
"to :manual:`cmake(1)` in a :manual:`ctest(1)` :ref:`Dashboard Client` "
"script, or on the :program:`ctest` command line via the :ctest-dashboard-"
"option:`-D` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CONFIGURE_OPTIONS.rst:12
msgid ""
"If the :command:`ctest_configure` command is given an explicit ``OPTIONS`` "
"argument, that argument takes precedence and this variable is ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CONFIGURE_OPTIONS.rst:15
msgid ""
"This variable is ignored when :variable:`CTEST_CONFIGURE_COMMAND` is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CONFIGURE_OPTIONS.rst:17
msgid ""
"Example --- pass an extra cache entry in a single ``ctest`` invocation::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CONFIGURE_OPTIONS.rst:19
msgid "ctest -T Configure -D CTEST_CONFIGURE_OPTIONS=-DFOO=ON"
msgstr ""
